504
00:57:13,480 --> 00:57:17,075
Oh, no. No, no.
I'm not... I'm not tense.

505
00:57:17,160 --> 00:57:20,391
No. Well, I did pass out today,

506
00:57:20,480 --> 00:57:24,109
