and brushed my teeth with shampoo,

507
00:57:24,200 --> 00:57:27,431
then butchered Rimsky-Korsakov
in front of 1500 people,

508
00:57:27,520 --> 00:57:30,990
but no, I'm not... I'm not tense.

509
00:57:31,080 --> 00:57:33,036
