518
00:58:13,600 --> 00:58:16,751
Now... isn't that better?

519
00:58:17,560 --> 00:58:20,677
Uh, well, I am a little hungry.

520
00:58:20,760 --> 00:58:22,273
Oh.

521
00:58:22,360 --> 00:58:24,749
