If he did, he wouldn't be a professional.

546
00:59:51,400 --> 00:59:55,029
Get out there and finish the job.
He's no good - look at those eyes.

547
00:59:55,120 --> 00:59:59,113
- This is ridiculous!
- Take the pants and put...

